{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"izar","id":"566079740591603714","is_bot":0,"username":"izarsystem"},"author_id":"566079740591603714","channel_id":"636706468116037642","content":"“Science can show us that we’re all of equal blood and heart, yet we elevate ourselves from others. How can I continue to do my job if I don’t agree with it? What else am I supposed to do? Chances are, I’ll be killed by the ‘subjects’ anyway.”","created_at":"2020-07-24T04:59:51.176000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"736085215495192597","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Basil","id":"339235123759153162","is_bot":0,"username":"divinedefault"},"author_id":"339235123759153162","channel_id":"636706468116037642","content":"\"You seem to have deceived yourself into believing you matter that much. You define yourself by your actions, not the actions of who you group with. If you're as powerful as you say, you can change what your 'job' works for. People will decide what to do with you from how they are treated no matter this 'social status' talk. If you are kind, you will be remembered.\"","created_at":"2020-07-24T05:03:42.582000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"736086186082172968","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"izar","id":"566079740591603714","is_bot":0,"username":"izarsystem"},"author_id":"566079740591603714","channel_id":"636706468116037642","content":"“I try to be kind, and people still hate me with seething fury. Like that man, goes by the name of a pasta...”","created_at":"2020-07-24T05:04:46.701000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"736086455016882277","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Basil","id":"339235123759153162","is_bot":0,"username":"divinedefault"},"author_id":"339235123759153162","channel_id":"636706468116037642","content":"\"The aarakokra? He's an unusual one, not as devious as that other pasta named man who was executed for arson. But struggle will always be there, the reason to endure is because kindness breeds joy. It helps us forget our own burdens for a time.\"","created_at":"2020-07-24T05:08:05.976000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"736087290836942888","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
