{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"izar","id":"566079740591603714","is_bot":0,"username":"izarsystem"},"author_id":"566079740591603714","channel_id":"636706468116037642","content":"“Thank you for your kindness,” They get up, still clutching the driftglobe in their hands, “I won’t forget it.” They stand on their tiptoes (they’re 6’2) to kiss you on the cheek before starting back into the city, the globe of light lazily bobbing to follow them, tail swaying back and forth a few inches off the ground. On the shield that’s strapped to her back, water drips down still, but faint shapes appear: five circles, and another circle at the top with three flowers on it. The symbol of the Medici.","created_at":"2020-07-24T05:14:12.610000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"736088828611264512","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
